            "review_title": "Review at Dhaba28 Indian Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Mee N\n1 contribution\n0\nVery good\nDec 2024 • Family\nVery nice and modern Indian restaurant with friendly service and an extensive menu with most of my favorites on the list. Had Railway lamb curry, Vegetable Dum Biryani, naan, and red wine. All were delicious and the fact they included Raita yogurt w cucumber as a complimentary side made me very happy. Great location, clean and newer modern design. Will return frequently.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 10, 2024",
